(e) she shall at the time of execution of bond, furnish the address to the investigating officer and the court concerned and shall not change his residence till the final disposal of the case till further orders;
(f) she shall not leave India without the permission of the Court and if having passport shall deposit the same before the Trial Court within a week; and R/CR.MA/645/2023 ORDER DATED:
19/01/2023 (g) it would be open to the Investigating Officer to file an application for remand if he considers it proper and just and the learned Magistrate would decide it on merits;

